Canada–China Global KPI Dashboard
Toolset: Power BI, SQL Server, BigFix, Power Automate, SharePoint
Users: IT teams across Canada and China plants (expanding to 5+ global sites)
Purpose: Track real-time IT performance KPIs, compliance status, and ticketing trends for global operations

- Key Features & Components:
KPI Scorecards
Tracks patch compliance %, SLA resolution time, ticket volume, and machine status across multiple plants

Regional Drilldowns
Filterable views for Canada and China sites with plant-specific compliance snapshots

Automated Refresh & Alerts
Power Automate used to refresh datasets daily and trigger alerts for:

Patch failures

Non-responsive agents

Critical SLA breaches

Data Model (Star Schema)
Central fact table sourced from SQL Server + BigFix API, joined to plant metadata, status types, and time dimensions

UX Enhancements

Dynamic slicers by location, date, and status

Clean layout with toggleable views (overview vs drilldown)

Bookmark-driven navigation to highlight problem areas

- Impact & Results:
Reduced manual tracking of IT tickets and patch status by 80%

Enabled proactive issue detection across continents

Contributed to global rollout planning across 5+ sites

Trained cross-functional teams to shift to self-serve Power BI model

